  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zimbabwe Reconstruction Trust Fund (ZIMREF) to improve the business environment for growth, strengthen resilience and improve the skill set of the Zimbabwean people</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Zimbabwe Reconstruction Trust Fund (ZIMREF) to improve the business environment for growth, strengthen resilience and improve the skill set of the Zimbabwean people is a component of Zimbabwe Reconstruction Fund (ZIMREF) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;5,400,000. It works in the following sector(s): Public finance management (PFM), Public sector policy and administrative management, Domestic revenue mobilisation.</narrative>
  </description>
